3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.218
It all starts with My Roster. Mark who
you own, add details by hand, and fill in

4
00:00:12.268 --> 00:00:16.958
from your UID, or import a GOOD file. Then
"Build Lab," "Your Next Upgrades," "Team

5
00:00:17.008 --> 00:00:19.585
Lab," and "Create a
Graphic" all reed from it.

6
